        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "E. The provisions of sub-section B shall apply to Christmas and Summer Season store associates, but their obligation after thirty-one (31) days of employment shall be expressly limited to the payment of and amount of money equal to the Union's regular and usual dues, plus a minimal administration fee. Summer Season and Christmas Employees shall have no obligation to pay an amount of money equal to the regular and usual fees; including initiation fees, unless they are retained on the Employer's regular roll at the end of their seasonal employment. The company will provide, on Monday, a weekly list of seasonals hired the previous week.",
            "block_bbox": [
